| first, conj onto rest | `9`, `[2 3 4]` |
| store put then get | `11` |
| gensym / stream make | `:p-0` / `{:type :stream-ref, :id :stream-0}` |

The three named deftests: `ffi => 42`, `blocked => :yin/blocked`, `stream round-trip => [99 99]` (captured in the same scratch run; matching literals were already asserted live in the old file).

